{"page_id": "olmo_old_scans_math-4_pg451-p1", "markdown": "# THEORY OF EQUATIONS\n\n435\n\nEx. 1. Prove that 5 is a root of the equation\n\nが-32-18&+40=0.\n\nDividing by x - 5,\n\n1-8-18+405\n\n+5+10-40\n\n1+2-8；\n\nSince there is no remainder, 5 is a root of the given equation.\n\n507. If f(x) is divided by x-a, the remainder of the division is equal to f(a). (Remainder Theorem, Chapter XVI.)\n\nUsing the notation of § 505, we have\n\n(e-a)Q() + R= f(2)-\n\nSubstituting x = a,\n\nR=f(a).\n\nEx. 2. 1f X（）=0-22-90+2, find./4）.\n\nDividing f(x) by x - 4,\n\nHence\n\n1-2-9+0+24\n\n+4+8-4-16\n\n1+2-1-4；-14 f（4）=- 14.\n\n508. The preceding method of substitution may also be dem onstrated as follows :\n\n2-223-922+0.2+24\n\n+423+822-420 -16\n\n3+22-22- 42；-14\n\nI.e. if x = 4,\n\nx* = 4x3, which added to the next term gives + 2 x?.\n\n2x3 = 8 x?, which added to the next term gives - x?.\n\n- x? = - 4 x, which added to the next term gives - 4 x.\n- 4x = - 16, which added to the next term gives - 14.\n\nTherefore\n\nバ（4）=-14.", "width": 902, "height": 1434, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "THEORY OF EQUATIONS", "bbox": {"x": 259.8476820130495, "y": 92.61249998560235, "width": 325.55629139072846, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "435", "bbox": {"x": 743.7019866149627, "y": 89.6249999159765, "width": 50.77483443708605, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ex. 1. Prove that 5 is a root of the equation", "bbox": {"x": 71.68211904897368, "y": 152.3624999921382, "width": 540.6026490066225, "height": 26.887499999999903}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "が-32-18&+40=0.", "bbox": {"x": 277.7682117663224, "y": 200.1624999870108, "width": 289.71523178807945, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dividing by x - 5,", "bbox": {"x": 74.66887401795138, "y": 250.94999998040976, "width": 194.13907284768212, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1-8-18+405", "bbox": {"x": 331.52980117516563, "y": 250.94999998415716, "width": 197.1258278145695, "height": 20.912500000000087}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "+5+10-40", "bbox": {"x": 352.4370848980133, "y": 277.83749973859375, "width": 143.36423841059602, "height": 20.912499999999927}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1+2-8；", "bbox": {"x": 331.2205252029352, "y": 312.14901718927945, "width": 128.95619689234042, "height": 23.787205475568815}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Since there is no remainder, 5 is a root of the given equation.", "bbox": {"x": 74.66887401530529, "y": 355.5124999939647, "width": 627.2185430463576, "height": 23.899999999999913}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "507. If f(x) is divided by x-a, the remainder of the division is equal to f(a). (Remainder Theorem, Chapter XVI.)", "bbox": {"x": 41.739567756521836, "y": 417.9773763635327, "width": 752.8359807500776, "height": 67.71633142232895}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Using the notation of § 505, we have", "bbox": {"x": 77.65562897250386, "y": 483.97499998850964, "width": 439.0529801324504, "height": 29.874999999999893}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(e-a)Q() + R= f(2)-", "bbox": {"x": 277.768211749068, "y": 531.7749999797146, "width": 283.74172185430467, "height": 32.86249999999988}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Substituting x = a,", "bbox": {"x": 74.08037861572973, "y": 577.5568801936339, "width": 225.2309523323514, "height": 29.241972267627823}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "R=f(a).", "bbox": {"x": 450.20648276485207, "y": 577.8810310499883, "width": 112.21936745043621, "height": 31.916113781929006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ex. 2. 1f X（）=0-22-90+2, find./4）.", "bbox": {"x": 71.3993477472592, "y": 637.12880557358, "width": 541.1478083528431, "height": 39.334225267171966}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dividing f(x) by x - 4,", "bbox": {"x": 71.68211905213107, "y": 684.1374999827643, "width": 244.91390728476821, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hence", "bbox": {"x": 71.64243204449745, "y": 830.3938171948629, "width": 68.77473751598636, "height": 21.174865257739924}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1-2-9+0+24", "bbox": {"x": 328.5430462061748, "y": 728.9499999852729, "width": 215.0463576158941, "height": 20.912499999999927}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "+4+8-4-16", "bbox": {"x": 346.46357601217744, "y": 755.8374999845474, "width": 176.21854304635767, "height": 17.924999999999937}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1+2-1-4；-14 f（4）=- 14.", "bbox": {"x": 325.55629124352413, "y": 788.6999999787128, "width": 212.0596026490066, "height": 62.73749999999993}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "508. The preceding method of substitution may also be dem onstrated as follows :", "bbox": {"x": 44.80132489758048, "y": 893.2624997978592, "width": 743.7019867549669, "height": 56.76249999999996}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2-223-922+0.2+24", "bbox": {"x": 274.78145680714925, "y": 973.9249999900417, "width": 319.5827814569536, "height": 20.912500000000087}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "+423+822-420 -16", "bbox": {"x": 301.66225152288445, "y": 1000.8124999870911, "width": 268.8079470198676, "height": 20.912499999999927}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "3+22-22- 42；-14", "bbox": {"x": 274.781456856158, "y": 1033.6749999834028, "width": 295.68874172185434, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "I.e. if x = 4,", "bbox": {"x": 74.66887401164735, "y": 1060.5624999663908, "width": 128.43046357615896, "height": 26.887499999999903}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "x* = 4x3, which added to the next term gives + 2 x?.", "bbox": {"x": 131.4172250392383, "y": 1099.3999996639063, "width": 561.5099337748344, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2x3 = 8 x?, which added to the next term gives - x?.", "bbox": {"x": 116.48344355683663, "y": 1144.2124999926937, "width": 558.5231788079469, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "x? = - 4 x, which added to the next term gives - 4 x. 4x = - 16, which added to the next term gives - 14.", "bbox": {"x": 101.54966874053567, "y": 1186.0374999918058, "width": 579.430463576159, "height": 68.71249999999992}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Therefore", "bbox": {"x": 77.65562893, "y": 1272.6749999641502, "width": 104.5364238410596, "height": 17.924999999999937}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "バ（4）=-14.", "bbox": {"x": 352.4370859469331, "y": 1272.6749999715478, "width": 134.40397350993382, "height": 23.899999999999913}}], "ms": 234.833334}